    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1204690/extras/7883d1b584f9aefc58aed2d7e4fa7e81.poster.avif?t=1715395679\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1204690/extras/7883d1b584f9aefc58aed2d7e4fa7e81.webm?t=1715395679\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1204690/extras/7883d1b584f9aefc58aed2d7e4fa7e81.mp4?t=1715395679\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1204690/extras/313b5f089bc8691cc363d1a45595dd97.poster.avif?t=1715395679\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1204690/extras/313b5f089bc8691cc363d1a45595dd97.webm?t=1715395679\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1204690/extras/313b5f089bc8691cc363d1a45595dd97.mp4?t=1715395679\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div> <br><br><strong>&quot;DISGUSTINGLY GORGEOUS...!!&quot;</strong><br>Uniting the best of simulation, RPG, and arcade Zombie titles, Dead Fury quickly surprises the player with its indie-like charm, and its fluid AAA-like look and feel.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1204690/extras/b5971b5695567a9c457c6459751b89c6.avif?t=1715395679\" /></div> <br><br>Welcome to &quot;Dead Fury,&quot; a fast-paced, zombie shooter set amidst the breathtaking landscape of New Zealand's South Island. But don't be fooled by the beautiful scenery \u2014 a deadly zombie virus has emerged from the permafrost, threatening to eradicate humanity and turn the world into a desolate wasteland.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1204690/extras/2df74ea5a06cb77ec3a7ec293454c4d1.avif?t=1715395679\" /></div> <br><br><strong>PLAY IN FIRST OR THIRD-PERSON PERSPECTIVES! </strong><br>Decimate hordes of freaks from either first or third-person perspectives. Your game, your choice. <br><br><strong>Hair Of The Zom...</strong><br>In &quot;Dead Fury,&quot; you'll play as Jaxon, Armed with an array of weapons and backed by the military, your mission is to collect plasma from defeated zombies \u2014 a crucial component for the temporary antidote known as the &quot;hair of the zom&quot;. Your survival, and the survival of your family, hinges on your ability to take down the infected and find a cure.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1204690/extras/544b2a8014445470f6e65c6b67bd19eb.avif?t=1715395679\" /></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1204690/extras/7883d1b584f9aefc58aed2d7e4fa7e81.poster.avif?t=1715395679\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1204690/extras/7883d1b584f9aefc58aed2d7e4fa7e81.webm?t=1715395679\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1204690/extras/7883d1b584f9aefc58aed2d7e4fa7e81.mp4?t=1715395679\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Not just &quot;another generic zombie shooter&quot; DEAD FURY Introduces a brand new game mode: &quot;HORDE ROYALE&quot; which brings the battle ring from Battle Royale titles like Fortnite, turns it into a raging forest fire that surrounds the player, and intensifies the action as it compresses the game space over time.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1204690/extras/1ab0a0931015f984c9b9c4379bb24832.avif?t=1715395679\" /></div> <br><br><strong>Action Action Action! </strong><br>DEAD FURY also stands on its own with its great balance of straight-to-the-point action and a refined to critical learning curve - allowing players of all capabilities to take on huge hordes of relentless and varying locomotion enemies.<br>Join us on this journey through a world on the brink of annihilation, and let's discover if you have what it takes to survive the fury of the dead<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1204690/extras/6f4e9add5fe538be99598db454258967.avif?t=1715395679\" /></div><br><br>&quot;Dead Fury, unlike its competitors, is EASY TO PICK UP AND HARD TO PUT DOWN.<br>Dead Fury thrusts players into the thick of battle without the need for hours of grinding - Players will be treated to a challenge that is both dynamic and satisfying, the ever-increasing and relentless zombie horde will ensure that.<br><br>REASONS TO PLAY<br>Get involved with a fast-paced and quickly developing game that listens to the community, appreciates the support, and will endeavor to add your recommendations to the game!<br>MAKE SURE YOU FOLLOW THE GAME ON THIS SITE, ON OUR WEBSITE OR YOUTUBE CHANNEL!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1204690/extras/7883d1b584f9aefc58aed2d7e4fa7e81.poster.avif?t=1715395679\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1204690/extras/7883d1b584f9aefc58aed2d7e4fa7e81.webm?t=1715395679\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1204690/extras/7883d1b584f9aefc58aed2d7e4fa7e81.mp4?t=1715395679\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>WISHLIST DEAD FURY TODAY! <br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1204690/extras/0a846cad658b1201675e7c7f1c79f8a1.avif?t=1715395679\" /></div>",
